---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact"
  description="Support and feedback information for InfraTrove."
>
  <article class="container prose">
    <div class="eyebrow">Feedback & corrections</div>
    <h1>Help make the tools better.</h1>
    <p>
      InfraTrove is in development. A public support address has not been
      configured yet.
    </p>
    <h2>Reporting a problem</h2>
    <p>
      When a support channel is available, include the tool name, browser
      version, steps to reproduce and a small, non-sensitive example. Do not
      include passwords, tokens, private keys or personal information.
    </p>
    <p>
      The maintainer must configure a working contact channel before public
      launch.
    </p>
    <a class="button" href="/tools/">
      Back to the tools
    </a>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
